  "description": "Reid Original Gravel | Gravel bike\n\nClassically styled, versatile and built for exploration – the ideal all-road gravel bike for everyday commuting, riding along gravel paths and discovering new routes at the weekend.\n\nThe Reid Bikes Original Gravel is designed to combine timeless steel-frame styling with practical versatility for everyday cycling and off-road adventures. Whether you're commuting through the city during the week or heading out to explore unfamiliar trails at the weekend, it's a dependable all-rounder built to make every ride enjoyable.\n\nIts forgiving steel frame and relaxed comfort geometry create a smooth, comfortable riding position for everyday journeys and longer rides. Designed to handle a variety of surfaces, the Original Gravel is equally at home navigating urban streets, following cycle paths or venturing onto gravel tracks and quieter country roads.\n\nA Shimano 14-speed drivetrain provides a versatile range of gears for tackling everyday commutes, rolling roads and moderate hills. Cantilever brakes deliver controlled stopping power, while Kenda tyres provide grip and versatility across a range of riding conditions, helping you transition between paved roads and gravel surfaces with confidence.\n\nCombining classic styling with a practical, adventure-ready setup, the Reid Bikes Original Gravel offers an accessible way to enjoy all-road cycling. Its comfortable geometry and versatile design make it a great choice for riders who want one bike for commuting, leisure rides and spontaneous weekend adventures.\n\nWhether you're finding a new route to work or getting lost exploring somewhere new, the Original Gravel is built to help you enjoy the journey as much as the destination.\n\nThe Reid Bikes Original Gravel bike is ideal for:\n\nEveryday commuters, looking for a versatile bike for travelling to work and navigating city streets\n\nGravel riding and off-road exploration, with a practical all-road design suited to gravel paths and mixed surfaces\n\nComfort-focused cyclists, with a forgiving steel frame and relaxed geometry for a smoother riding experience\n\nRiders tackling varied routes, with Shimano 14-speed gearing for everyday journeys and moderate hills\n\nConfident everyday braking, with cantilever brakes for controlled stopping\n\nWeekend adventures, offering the versatility to explore new routes, country roads and gravel tracks\n\nRiders who appreciate classic styling, with a timeless steel-frame design that combines traditional looks with everyday practicality\n\nCyclists seeking one bike for multiple uses, providing a practical balance of commuting, leisure riding and off-road exploration\n\nAnyone looking to discover more on two wheels, with an approachable all-road bike built for everyday journeys and spontaneous adventures",
